as/d7ad485246708738c4bd4c249f67eb9b.mp4?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/1fc073aac5802d870616778bfd43b749.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, day-night cycles, and shifting seasons will dictate your army's marching pace and the flow of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense forests and tall grass conceal your movements, treacherous muddy swamps slow advancements, and blinding sandstorms or toxic miasma introduce unpredictable variables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your surroundings and turn these natural conditions into the ultimate tactical advantage to crush your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/8428fdb314e5f6f6b0ea421756336225.avif?t=1784887351\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras_big/8428fdb314e5f6f6b0ea421756336225.avif?t=1784887351 width=1560 height=870 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/ebf872511795d588bc3e033a4d1025bc.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every great military campaign relies on a solid foundation of fortifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct defensive towers to halt enemy charges, establish medical camps to support your frontline, and build production sites to forge siege engines and amplify your firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the battlefield and adjust your deployments in real-time to maintain absolute supremacy over your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d01cda28d42bc53c3777638b9c5df73f.poster.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d01cda28d42bc53c3777638b9c5df73f.webm?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d01cda28d42bc53c3777638b9c5df73f.mp4?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/5280186ff72025b047f699eb6da213d6.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An army marches on its stomach. Every supply route is a vital lifeline that decides victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your allies must personally escort grain and ration convoys, constantly fending off enemy raids and deadly interceptions along the way. Once a supply line is severed, even the most overwhelming advantage can instantly collapse. Protect your logistics, and you secure the key to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d8563f8437ec422d7ce988ccfa1dd21c.poster.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d8563f8437ec422d7ce988ccfa1dd21c.webm?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d8563f8437ec422d7ce988ccfa1dd21c.mp4?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/214fd67c0d788c798979a1f9399f26b2.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit the peerless martial prowess of epoch-defining generals like Guan Yu and Lu Bu to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-new mechanic allows you to learn and execute the exclusive signature techniques of these historical legends. Experience uniquely stylized skill animations and devastating power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the exclusive abilities of different Three Kingdoms heroes to plunge into enemy formations and execute your rivals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/12b2637114b71c93dc7e6a4b4baf2a83.poster.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/12b2637114b71c93dc7e6a4b4baf2a83.webm?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/12b2637114b71c93dc7e6a4b4baf2a83.mp4?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/003adb6ccf9d091eb11f2b44b2da1712.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new combat mode introduces a thrilling, high-stakes 5v5vE experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will dive into dangerous, heavily guarded zones to fight over top-tier loot against rival squads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a ruthless game of survival—if your character dies, all your carried items will be dropped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the team that slays the final boss can claim victory and leave the battlefield fully loaded.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/9a081e6c258d3653df5e381c9e4f9074.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the global war reaches its boiling point, all top-tier factions will march on the ultimate battleground: Luoyang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final showdown unfolds in a massive new warzone, where nearly a hundred players fight simultaneously, fiercely contesting key strongholds, camps, and strategic chokepoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building fortifications, deploying siege weapons, and reinforcing the frontline—every single tactical command can turn the tide and become the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this absolute climax, overpowering your enemies requires more than just brute strength, courage, and cunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It ultimately depends on the unspoken trust between you and your allies, as well as the battle-forged instincts you've honed throughout your relentless campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d7afceb4486e305a87841824ec228cd1.poster.avif?t=1784887351\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d7afceb4486e305a87841824ec228cd1.webm?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/extras/d7afceb4486e305a87841824ec228cd1.mp4?t=1784887351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Conqueror's Blade: Three Kingdoms is an open-world action war game blending hero combat and troop command. Lead legendary armies alongside allies to siege cities and claim vital resources. Forge alliances, crush rival factions, and seize the realm with steel and strategy!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Thai, Portuguese - Brazil, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/2ea0aeff7baace1773177b4a470ba17158831276/header.jpg?t=1784887351", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/3cbfcbf0a8f63e1f0ca02a2c0a6e4f374670215f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784887351", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651220/3cbfcbf0a8f63e1f0ca02a2c0a6e4f374670215f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784887351", "website": "https://threekingdoms.conquerorsblade.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD R5 3500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 /  AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is strongly recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires 